<title>UK: India's STC buyers 6,000 tonnes of olein - trade.</title>
<headline>India's STC buyers 6,000 tonnes of olein - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's State Trading Corporation (STC) bought one parcel of palm olein at it's tender on Tuesday, European vegetable oil traders said.</p>
<p>The STC bought 6,000 tonnes at $572.40 c and f for October 5-20 shipment from FELDA, they said.</p>
<p>India's last bought on September 13 when they purchased one parcel at $582 a tonne c and f also for October 5-20 shipment.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
